# SCM syntax highlighting & preventing 3-way merges
# linguist-* collapses the diff on GitHub; GitLab uses its own
# gitlab-generated attribute. Diffs are left enabled (no -diff) so the
# lock stays reviewable -- merge=binary is what prevents a 3-way merge
# producing a parseable but inconsistent lock.
pixi.lock merge=binary linguist-language=YAML linguist-generated=true gitlab-generated
